Karabas Go / Mini G — Atari 800XL core
=======================================

This repository is a port of the Atari 800XL core to the Karabas Go / Mini G
boards.  It is not an official Atari or MiSTer release.

Main license for the Karabas port files (top levels, video, SRAM controller,
ATR/XEX loaders, tools, testbenches):
