Karabas firmware and tools
--------------------------
`tools/karabas.py`, `tools/make_core.py` follow the Karabas Go project:
https://github.com/andykarpov/karabas-go-firmware
The firmware itself is not part of this repository.

ROM data
--------
No Atari XL OS/BASIC ROM files are shipped in this repository.  The core uses
the Altirra ROM set compiled into BRAM.  Third-party game images (`.xex`,
`.atr`) are not part of the repository.
